{"last_link_id": 21, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# MiniMax H3 in 4 steps (text to video, with sound)\n\n**What it does:** a 5 second clip with its own sound, from one prompt, in 4 steps.\nA small speed LoRA (PDMD 4-step) sits between the model and the sampler.\n\n**Settings that belong to this file:** 4 steps, sampler **euler**, scheduler simple, shift 12 / 3,\n1344 x 768, 124 frames at 24 fps. No CFG: the Basic Guider is correct, do not swap it for a CFG guider.\n\n**Files** (the model, text encoder and both VAEs are the same as every H3 workflow):\n- `ComfyUI/models/loras/minimax_h3_pdmd_4nfe_comfyui_v6.safetensors`\n- `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- text encoder `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` (type **minimax**)\n- `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors` and `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n**Want it faster?** Load the 2-step file instead (stableyogi-h3-pdmd-2step.json). It takes about half the time. The scene can drift a little from your prompt, so use it to find a prompt, then render the keeper here.\n\n**Frame count rule:** 17 times something, plus five. 73, 124, 192, 277.\nRead QUICKSTART.md for the download links. Help, prompts and more free workflows: https://forgebun.com/go/h3pdmdwf\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Start here - read this first", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [860, 360], "pos": [-1424.2111640182814, 16.347886151832235], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "# MiniMax H3 in 4 steps (text to video, with sound)\n\n**What it does:** a 5 second clip with its own sound, from one prompt, in 4 steps.\nA small speed LoRA (PDMD 4-step) sits between the model and the sampler.\n\n**Settings that belong to this file:** 4 steps, sampler **euler**, scheduler simple, shift 12 / 3,\n1344 x 768, 124 frames at 24 fps. No CFG: the Basic Guider is 